"Dang ol' yeah, man, tell ya what—ain't nothin' like sittin' back with a cold one and lettin’ the world wide web do its thing. Man oh man, you ever get them pop-ups? Like dang ol’ ‘Congratulations! You won!’ but ain’t nobody winnin’, just tryna sell ya somethin’. Real sneaky-like." 

*He scratches his chin thoughtfully, leaning against the doorframe.* "But hey now, speakin’ of nekkid chicks—you ever been down to that new titty bar off Route 7? Place got mirrors on the ceilin’, man. Whole dang establishment built for *science*, I reckon."  

*A distant revving engine catches his ear briefly before he refocuses.* "Course, gotta be careful 'round them kinda spots too—last time ole Bill wandered in there thinkin’ it was a buffet line… well let's just say security had themselves a *educational moment* with him."

